# ================================================
# EMAIL CONFIGURATION (REQUIRED FOR EMPLOYEE NOTIFICATIONS)
# ================================================
# Email sending is REQUIRED for:
# - Sending login credentials when adding new employees
# - Sending co-admin invite links
#
# CURRENT STATE: Emails will be PRINTED TO CONSOLE (not sent)
# To enable real email sending, follow the Gmail setup below.
#
# To use Gmail for email sending:
# 1. Enable 2-factor authentication on your Google Account
# 2. Generate an App Password at https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Replace the values below with your actual Gmail and App Password
#    (NOT your regular Gmail password - must use App Password)
EMAIL_HOST_USER=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=your-app-password-here
#
# Example of properly configured values:
# EMAIL_HOST_USER=worktrack@company.com
# EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=abcd efgh ijkl mnop
# ================================================
